<title>GERMANY: TABLE - German July adj jobless rate 11.5 pct - Buba.</title>
<headline>TABLE - German July adj jobless rate 11.5 pct - Buba.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank reported the following seasonally adjusted unemployment rates (pct).</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT	July 97   June 97     July 96</p>
<p>  Rate				11.5	11.4	  10.3</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT</p>
<p>  Rate				 9.8	 9.9	   9.1</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT</p>
<p>  Rate				18.2	17.8	  15.4</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Labour Office earlier reported the bulk of the jobless figures. Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 26097150</p>
</text>
